      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "How interesting! A great deal of what explorers do is collect pieces of rubble and try to rebuild broken artifacts.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_10.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You see, the Celestians were very big on building secret meaning into their architecture and décor, even their city layout.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_11.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You can read a lot about a culture from how they build their walls, floors, and ceilings. Messages hidden everywhere!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_12.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "That said... if the monolith has recently been broken, then it is likely the work of the sharks of the Piscean Guard.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_13.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "They are crude vandals, always chopping at the Celestian artifacts and architecture, using pieces of stone for currency.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_14.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Sometimes being an explorer is investigation, and sometimes it’s throwing a bit of muscle around.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_15.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Could you go and recover some of the pieces of the broken monolith from the Piscean Guard?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_16.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Great work! I think you got all the missing pieces!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_17.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
