  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It’s a madhouse down here, to be certain! It’s the sharks that are causing most of the trouble.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_02.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They call themselves the Piscean Guard, and they claim to serve the Crustacean Empire, whatever that is.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_03.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They’ve prevented us from our main work: surveying the region and learning what we can about Celestian culture.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I assume that you’re here to rescue us, and to learn about the Celestian schools of magic... Stars, Moon, and Sun. Right?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If you want to rediscover the secrets of Celestian magic, then you must become one of us: an explorer!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "First lesson: observation! Based on where it stands, that broken monolith is undoubtedly the key to entering the area beyond.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Would you be so kind as to go and survey that monolith and return here with your findings?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Excavator02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ThorntonLewis_CEL_08.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 227117,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "CL-DIST-NPC01_Persona",
